### Next Steps for Activation:
To enable analytics tracking in production:
1. Deploy the application to Vercel
2. Navigate to your project dashboard on Vercel
3. Go to the Analytics section
4. Click the "Enable" button to activate Web Analytics
5. Analytics will begin tracking page views automatically

